# NOTICE

This plugin wraps the official Google Antigravity CLI (`agy`) and performs no
OAuth of its own and stores no credentials. Authentication is handled entirely
by the `agy` binary (Google sign-in / AI credits).

- The plugin's job logs may contain the prompts delegated to agy and agy's
  outputs. Do not delegate prompts that contain secrets.
- The stop-review gate is a best-effort heuristic and fails OPEN (allows
  stopping) on any timeout or parse error.
- Review runs are read-only: the companion never passes
  `--dangerously-skip-permissions` for review/adversarial-review jobs.
